# Gotchas & Do-Nots

## Active / recently fixed

### Shad vertical offset (priority)
- `cells.shad.dy` in `glyph-layout.json` controls shad `margin-top`
- **Must use px calc, NOT `u()`** (see `tlt-glyph-grid` rule)
- Symptom: devtools shows `calc(0 * var(--u))` → wrong code path still live
- Fix is in `glyph-display.js` ~line 121; verify with `git log` before re-patching

### Diagnosing shad offset
1. Check `glyph-layout.json` → `cells.shad.dy` has the intended value (e.g. `-20`)
2. Check devtools inline style on `.glyph-part--shad` — should show a px value, not `calc(0 * ...)`
3. If still wrong: confirm `dy` is read from `cells.shad.dy` **before** `marginTop` is set

## Do NOT
- Target path `/Users/JR/repo/tlt-pronunciation` — wrong (see `tlt-local-path` rule)
- Use cloud-only agents with no local repo access on this project
- Do long SVG archaeology in the master SVG files — use sliced assets in `assets/svg/consonants/`
- Hardcode layout numbers in JS — always put them in `glyph-layout.json`
- Use `u(cells.shad.dy)` for shad margin — this is the known bad pattern

